  "rationale": "Only patch_struts and waf are deployed, and both block only exploit_struts_cve_2017_5638. The attacker can instead gain the foothold with spearphish_employee, because email_filtering and security_awareness are not deployed. From there, every later stage has at least one unblocked technique: internal_reconnaissance reaches recon (it has no blocking controls); steal_config_credentials or dump_process_memory reaches creds (credential_vaulting and edr are not deployed); smb_lateral_movement or vpn_pivot reaches lateral (network_segmentation and vpn_mfa are not deployed); query_pii_database or read_database_replica reaches db_access (db_access_control and replica_isolation are not deployed); and exfiltrate_over_dns or exfiltrate_over_https reaches exfiltrated (dns_monitoring and proxy_tls_inspection are not deployed). So the goal is still reachable."
 },
